    "detailed_description": "A horror game focused on a mystery story. In addition to an experimental system where game events are controlled by an AI, making these events dynamic, making each game unique.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is part of a series of original games called THE UNKNOWN FEAR which will be 5 horror and mystery games. Each game will tell a part of this story and only with the 5 will everything make sense.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this first game you will play the role of a person who doesn't even remember his own name, but who will be forced to complete a task given by a mysterious scientist who is indifferent to his safety and promises in exchange his freedom and a new life.",
